WEBVTT

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:10.180
My turn.  I summon Phantom Beast Wild-Horn.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.830
They're fighting hard to see who goes first!

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.800
I won't let you have the first corner!

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:26.330
Inferno Hammer attacks Windmill Genex!

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.510
It's becoming more complete.

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:39.480
Riding Duels is its power source.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:44.960
When the Circuit is complete, 
the future will change.

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:57.270
It's stabilizing.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:00.840
Let's raise the fragment gear.

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:01.660
Yeah.

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:11.740
Jean!  Andore!

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:15.260
Breo!

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:18.460
Yusei, Jack...

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:20.560
What happened?

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:24.190
Even I don't know.

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:27.030
Their D-Wheels suddenly 
crashed during the duel.

00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:31.880
Jean!

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:35.390
Sorry, I'll contact you later.

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:36.710
Are you okay, Jean?

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:39.380
I'm back.

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.400
Welcome home.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:44.580
Crow, how's your shoulder?

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:48.590
It's fine now.  I can ride anytime.

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:50.030
See?

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:50.820
Ouch...

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:53.230
You're still hurt.

00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:56.170
Did you meet Jean at the hospital?

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:59.390
No, they still can't have any visitors.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:00.390
I see.

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:04.590
Riding Duels.

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:07.690
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:14.300
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:35.840
Reach out your hand and grab a bright tomorrow

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:45.630
Soar in the infinite skies   BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:51.950
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:58.040
My hand sweats as the battle intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:03.820
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:09.660
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:15.820
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:21.630
Remember that you have friends waiting for you

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:27.800
I'm not scared and I'll never give up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:34.220
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:03:58.180 --> 00:04:03.950
Envoys of Destruction  Team Catastrophe

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:12.670
During the match against Team Unicorn, 
it took everything I had to get to Yusei.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.830
You take 800 points of damage!

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:18.190
I activate the trap Wicked Rebirth!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:18.760
What?

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:21.960
I pay 800 life points

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:27.540
to Special Summon a Synchro Monster 
without its effects from my graveyard!

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:29.770
Stardust Dragon!

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:42.820
The next match is against Team Catastrophe, 
the team that defeated Team Unicorn.

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:49.840
If I don't improve, we won't win!  
I have to hone my riding techniques!

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.930
Cursed D-Wheelers?

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:57.130
Team Unicorn crashed twice in a row.

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:01.900
They're rumored to be using strange magic!

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.710
You're leaning too close to him!

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.850
Magic?  What garbage.

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:11.420
Jack Atlas will crush them.

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:20.760
This!  And this!  And this!

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:23.720
All the newspapers have articles about us!

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:27.480
Luck is finally in our favor, Nicolas.

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:30.100
Yeah.

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:34.670
It's all due to the stranger's card.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:38.580
Shadow card?

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.740
You're giving it to us?

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:48.000
Are you okay, Hermann?

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:49.230
Yeah...

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:53.750
Who is he?  He suddenly appeared 
in front of me and sent me flying.

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:58.490
As long as you have that card, 
you'll no longer struggle.

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:00.260
You'll win all your duels.

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:02.090
You can even become King.

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:05.970
King?

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.800
A shadow card...

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.040
Interesting.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:16.730
Wait a second, Nicolas.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.010
Are you sure it's safe to use that card?

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:22.540
A shadow card must be a dangerous card.

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:25.460
Besides, there's something creepy about him.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.430
He's gone!

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:29.370
Where did he go?

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.740
Now it's even creepier.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.240
So what?

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:38.700
I'm sick of this city and our lifestyle!

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.970
I'm fine having a shadow card!

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:46.220
I'll sell my soul to escape from this dump!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.440
Nicolas...

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:55.430
I'll make my way up.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:02.290
Hans, you seem happy.

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:04.260
I found her, Nicolas.

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:07.730
Good.  Let's go, Hermann and Hans!

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:12.930
It's Breo.

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:18.220
Did he learn something?

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.500
I think so.

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:22.000
Wait, Jack!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.630
You didn't pay the bill!

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:25.000
Put it on Jack's tab!

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:29.880
Don't you mean the opposite?  
You should pay for Jack!

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:31.350
What?

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:34.580
There was strange data on 
the D-Wheel memory chip?

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:40.060
I couldn't believe that Jean and Andore 
would both crash, so I checked it.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.600
Look right there.

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:44.490
What's this?

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:46.940
It shows that the wheels locked.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:47.960
Locked?

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:52.430
Yes, as if something was 
caught in the wheels.

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:55.850
That would explain why they crashed.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:59.170
Does that mean they jammed 
something into the wheels?

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:03.150
But they can't do that during a duel.

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.520
What is it, Crow?

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:11.080
When my Blackbird crashed, I felt 
that my wheels locked for an instant.

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:12.020
What?

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:16.540
This is that data.

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:18.460
It's the same.

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:23.580
It means that they caused Blackbird to crash!

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:25.430
Damn!  I won't forgive them!

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:27.100
Calm down, Crow.

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:31.910
This isn't enough evidence to prove 
that Team Catastrophe is to blame.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.430
But how did they do it?

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:39.660
It's hard to lock the wheels 
without their opponents noticing.

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:43.280
And no one saw anything during the duel.

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:48.840
Oh yeah!  I have video of the duel between 
Unicorn and Catastrophe, so let's look at it!

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.420
We might learn something!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:56.480
Did I do something wrong?

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:59.640
If you have video, hurry up and show us!

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:01.300
I'm sorry!

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:06.740
This is video of the duel between 
Andore and Team Catastrophe's Nicolas.

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:13.290
What happened?

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.750
Let's look from another angle.

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:19.480
Show that part again.

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:30.920
I didn't see anything.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:33.230
Next is Jean's footage.

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:37.590
This is the duel between Jean 
and Team Catastrophe's Hermann.

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:41.210
Huh?  He's already affected.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:44.050
We haven't learned anything.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:46.700
What concerns me is this monster.

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:49.650
It's already summoned by 
the time the wheels lock.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:53.390
The monster's name is Hook the Hidden Knight.

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:57.550
Level 4, 1600 attack 
points, 0 defense points.

00:09:57.550 --> 00:09:59.360
According to the duel records,

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:05.330
Andore crashed when his D.D. 
Unicorn Knight tried to attack it.

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:08.060
Jean crashed during the opponent's turn.

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:11.200
It happened right after the 
monster's effect activated.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:13.430
See?  Something just moved.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:18.780
This must have something to do with it.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.690
Jack and Yusei, be careful.

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:23.010
They already attacked Crow.

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:25.880
You don't know who they'll attack next.

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:28.000
Oh no.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.750
Someone isn't here.

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:31.490
Aki is in danger!

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:48.200
I summon Rose Tentacles!

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:56.480
My powers didn't activate?

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:06.400
We got her!

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:09.790
Only Yusei Fudo and Jack Atlas are left.

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:11.730
Sucker!

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:19.190
Yeah, we're fine.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.980
I just spoke with Aki's parents.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:27.530
She's badly bruised, but 
her life isn't in danger.

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:30.410
How about you?

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.650
Were you able to retrieve the data?

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:36.120
That means...

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:40.090
There's evidence that the wheels locked.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:41.720
I understand.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:42.810
Those punks!

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:43.690
Crow!

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:44.590
Where are you going?

00:11:44.590 --> 00:11:48.560
I'm going to find them and beat them up!

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:49.500
Stop, Crow!

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:54.290
I know how you feel, but if you do 
that, we're no different than them!

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.640
But we have to do something!

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:59.110
We'll deal with them in a duel!

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:04.090
Fine.

00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:07.510
And I'll be the one to deal with them!

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:08.980
You?

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:13.950
I can't stay quiet after what 
happened to my teammate!

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:19.430
Besides, if I didn't mess up in the first 
place, this wouldn't have happened.

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:22.440
I'll get Aki's revenge!

00:12:39.010 --> 00:12:41.480
What?  The wheels locked?

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:46.760
Yeah!  I don't know how, 
but it's a huge scoop!

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:50.240
So that's the cause the D-Wheelers' curse.

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:52.320
Why didn't you tell us in the first place?

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:55.430
If it's true, their card 
and duels are illegal!

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:58.190
I'll check their cards immediately!

00:12:58.190 --> 00:12:58.900
Wait.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:02.620
Yusei's team fully understands the situation,

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:06.760
but they want to settle 
things with their own hands.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:09.110
This is their decision.

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:10.520
But still...

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:12.780
Please let them handle it!

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.810
I'll pretend that I didn't hear anything.

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:18.700
Mikage!

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:21.550
Sit down.  It's about to start.

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:26.350
Hello, everybody!

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:28.490
Are you excited?

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:33.960
The World Riding Duel 
Grand Prix's preliminaries

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:39.340
to crown the world's best Riding 
Duelists are almost over!

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:41.520
There's an astounding card today!

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:44.810
I'll introduce the teams!

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:52.310
The first team won by making Team 
Unicorn crash!  Team Catastrophe!

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:55.800
All right, Catastrophe!

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:57.250
Crush them today!

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:00.330
There better not be any crashes today!

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:03.470
Shut up!  We're looking forward to that!

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:04.230
What?

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:09.390
What an atmosphere!

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:11.570
Will Jack be okay?

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:18.010
Facing them is the team led by Fortune 
Cup winner Yusei Fudo!  Team 5D's!

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:26.650
Jack!

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:31.800
Master Atlas!

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.590
I knew this would happen.

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:38.590
Rua!  Ruka!  Yusei!

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:45.200
They don't realize that we'll crush them.

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:52.680
Why is he here?  Isn't 
he supposed to be hurt?

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:54.940
We'll just crush him again.

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:55.910
Don't get nervous!

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:57.880
He's coming this way.

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:02.780
Shouldn't you be in the hospital?

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:03.950
What do you want?

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:06.330
I just wanted to say hi.

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:11.830
I'll get revenge for Jean, Andore and Aki!

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:13.160
What?

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:16.480
Oh, and I also have to get my revenge.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:19.130
I don't know what magic you're using,

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:21.790
but I won't fall for it twice!

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.100
Prepare yourself!

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:26.160
We should say that to you.

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:29.080
Your body just healed, so 
you should take care of it.

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.690
Thanks for the warning.

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:33.610
See you later.

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:36.510
He's making fun of us!

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:39.370
Does he know about that card?

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:46.030
No.  They're suspicious, but 
they don't know its identity.

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:51.160
Their only chance of finding 
out is when they die!

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.480
The match is about to begin!

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:59.400
5D's first wheeler is Crow, and 
it's Hermann for Catastrophe!

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:01.560
Speed World 2 set.

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:06.780
Finish him quickly, Hermann.

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:15.240
Beating up the injured isn't nice, 
but I like doing bad things.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.220
Don't get mad at me, kid.

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:20.190
Will Crow be okay?

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.660
His shoulder hasn't healed yet.

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:26.130
We have no choice because 
he won't listen to us.

00:16:26.490 --> 00:16:28.500
Crow will be okay.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:37.510
If a card caused that strange duel,

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:41.480
then Iliaster must be involved.

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:51.800
I knew you were behind this, Placido.

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:53.590
I thought something was up.

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:54.830
Luciano.

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:59.690
I don't care if Jose gets mad 
at you for acting on your own.

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:04.800
That geezer is wasting 
our time with the WRGP.

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:07.670
I'll do things my way.

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:09.920
Good luck.

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:14.410
It's about to start!

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:18.880
Aki, I'll get your revenge.

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:25.920
Riding Duel!  Acceleration!

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:36.330
Whoa!  Crow is off to a slow start!

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:37.570
Crow!

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:40.970
I can withstand this pain.

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:47.010
He's speeding up and catching up to Hermann!

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:51.780
I see.

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:55.280
Crow and Hermann have entered 
the first corner simultaneously!

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:02.920
This is a fierce battle 
to see who goes first!

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:08.630
Whoa!  Crow is behind!

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:11.600
Hermann took the first corner!

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:14.500
That was dirty!

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:17.240
Good!  We go first!

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:21.050
The duel now begins!  Hermann goes first!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.480
Let's go!

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:30.790
Duel!

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:35.820
My turn.  I summon Hook the Hidden Knight.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.730
I set one card and end my turn.

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:46.830
It already appeared!

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:51.120
That's the monster that locked the wheels!

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:58.280
I was waiting for that crooked monster!

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.550
I'll defeat you!

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:02.300
My-

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.840
My turn!

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:10.020
I summon Blackwing - Sirocco the Dawn!

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:18.460
Good!  Sirocco the Dawn 
has higher attack points!

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:21.200
Sirocco the Dawn is a high-Level monster,

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:26.440
but I can summon it without tribute 
when only the opponent has monsters!

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:31.210
Bring it on!  I'll find out 
how you lock the wheels!

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:35.660
Sirocco the Dawn attacks 
Hook the Hidden Knight!

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:37.520
Dark Wing Slash!

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.520
Crow is attacking!

00:19:42.920 --> 00:19:45.090
It's the same situation as Andore's!

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:46.890
Watch closely.

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:47.560
Right.

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:53.870
That attack can't defeat me!

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:57.540
I activate Hook the Hidden 
Knight's effect!  Shadow Hook!

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:01.100
If you attack this card when 
it's in attack position,

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:04.970
both our monsters switch to defense position!

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:10.510
Defense position?

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:13.650
Since they're both in defense 
position, the battle is negated!

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:18.110
When Hook the Hidden Knight switches 
from attack to defense position,

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:21.480
you take 800 points of damage.

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:22.600
